  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "On-Policy Omni Distillation (OPOD) and Student-Centered Distillation represent advancements in on-policy distillation frameworks that combine multimodal capabilities in a shared model, while addressing gaps between teachers and students in large language models. These approaches use route-based guidance and reinforcement learning to improve model performance. Together, these findings demonstrate two ways distillation can be used for AI safety: incriminating misaligned models, and extracting their capabilities without their misalignment.",
